WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.280
¿Tienes miedo de alguien?

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.840
I have trust issues.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.760
With who?

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.440
Everyone.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.440
Step back.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.120
A few weeks ago,

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.040
I find out that

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.080
our family was in danger.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.920
Why should I care about the Powells?

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.120
When I'm saying

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.960
“our family”

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.000
I mean you,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.640
your grandfather and myself.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.920
So I have to stay close to you

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.480
to keep you safe.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.480
That was your grandfather’s condition.
